      "locked": false,
      "text": "Current understanding. ( let understand with 1:1 which can be exted to multiple. )\n\nin side code. \n- client1 join -> nothing much happen\n- client 2 join, -> assume like startBtn there is joinBtn ( not written in code doing same thing )\n- now client 2 send offer , client one receive and return answer.\n- now client 1 recieve that answer.\n- and set it as shown in code.\n- now client2 got the idea of new candidate\n- and .onicecandidate will trigger and it will send the candidate\n- client 1 receive the candiate and add ice candidate.\n- now protocol done and start sharing video.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Current understanding. ( let understand with 1:1 which can be exted to multiple. )\n\nin side code. \n- client1 join -> nothing much happen\n- client 2 join, -> assume like startBtn there is joinBtn ( not written in code doing same thing )\n- now client 2 send offer , client one receive and return answer.\n- now client 1 recieve that answer.\n- and set it as shown in code.\n- now client2 got the idea of new candidate\n- and .onicecandidate will trigger and it will send the candidate\n- client 1 receive the candiate and add ice candidate.\n- now protocol done and start sharing video.",
